 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSummit Medical Devices Inc                                         MASTER SERVICES\n88 Commerce Drive, 80201 Denver, United States                    AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US74-3008992\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\n\nSummit Medical Devices Inc                                        Crestview Supplies LLC\n88 Commerce Drive                                                 1200 Industrial Parkway\n80201 Denver                                                      62701 Springfield\nUnited States                                                     United States\nVAT: US74-3008992\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 02/26/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Summit\nMedical Devices Inc, with its registered office at 88 Commerce Drive, Denver (\"Party A\"), and Crestview Supplies LLC, with its registered\noffice at 1200 Industrial Parkway, Springfield (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\nParty A      Summit Medical Devices Inc / John Carter\nParty B      Crestview Supplies LLC / Maria Lopez\nDate         02/26/2026",
